  <spoon:CtClass name="SRangerController">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="SRanger reactive single-controller state machine (SR-ARCH1, SR-ARCH2).&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>Three modes (SR-DM1): Moving (initial), Turning, Final. The robot drives&#xA;forward in Moving, rotates in place in Turning for a fixed duration, and&#xA;stops permanently in Final when the operator issues endTask. The Move&#xA;command issued on entering each mode is the mode's entry action&#xA;(SR-FR1 &#x2026; SR-FR3).&lt;/p>"/>
    <modifier>FINAL</modifier>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
